      "MELANIE: Laugh now, tomorrow it'll be us.\nPAN: Not us, you. I just make the coffee.\nPAN: It means you don’t wake up. Drink your coffee.",
      "MELANIE: Okay, people, we’re officially late!\nPAN: Melanie! Melanie! This dress is supposed to be Neon Aubergine but it’s all wrong! 5 It’s all wrong!\nMELANIE: Put her on after Anouk. Third light cue is yellow, she’1l look eggplant. Oh, and Pan, it’s all wrong because it’s on backwards. Tabatha?\nTABATHA: Over here, darling!",
      "MELANIE: Sorry, honey, she just grabbed my hand. What was I supposed to do?\nTABATHA: But you would’ve called me first?",
      "PEARL: Come to Momma, sugar!\nMELANIE: Hey, Momma.\nPEARL: My god, look at you, you’re skin and bones! Oh, c'mon, don’t I get a smile? There’s gotta be one in there somewhere,",
      "MELANIE: There are hardly words.\nPEARL: Honey, what kinda trouble did you get into?\nMELANIE: Trouble? Oh, nothing.\nPEARL: ...ifm just saying if this is how you spend your first night in town, I’d hate to think what you’re up to in that God- forsaken city."
    ]
